<section class="sec" id="compliance"><div class="wrap">
 <div class="sec-head reveal"><span class="eyebrow center" data-en="Records and control" data-sw="Kumbukumbu na udhibiti">Records and control</span><h2 data-en="Stay in control of your business." data-sw="Dhibiti biashara yako.">Stay in control of your business.</h2><p data-en="Keep your sales organised, manage access and review your business with confidence." data-sw="Panga mauzo, dhibiti ufikiaji na pitia biashara yako kwa uhakika.">Keep your sales organised, manage access and review your business with confidence.</p></div>
