 <p class="comp-note" data-en="Tax-authority integrations are not currently live. A sales receipt is not a substitute for a tax invoice where one is required." data-sw="Miunganisho ya mamlaka ya kodi bado haifanyi kazi moja kwa moja. Risiti ya mauzo si mbadala wa ankara ya kodi inapohitajika.">Tax-authority integrations are not currently live. A sales receipt is not a substitute for a tax invoice where one is required.</p>
